export async function ensurePmd(view,id){if(view.pmd?.[id]){view.loadPmd?.();return true}view.pmdRequests??=new Map();if(view.pmdRequests.has(id))return view.pmdRequests.get(id);const request=(async()=>{try{const base=`https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PMDCollab/SpriteCollab/master/sprite/${String(id).padStart(4,'0')}/`,r=await fetch(base+'AnimData.xml',{signal:AbortSignal.timeout(9000)});if(!r.ok)return false;const xml=await r.text(),all={};for(const match of xml.matchAll(/<Anim>([\s\S]*?)<\/Anim>/g)){const t=match[1],tag=n=>t.match(new RegExp(`<${n}>([^<]+)</${n}>`))?.[1],name=tag('Name');all[name]={name,copy:tag('CopyOf'),width:+tag('FrameWidth'),height:+tag('FrameHeight'),hit:+tag('HitFrame'),durations:[...t.matchAll(/<Duration>(\d+)<\/Duration>/g)].map(x=>+x[1])}}const anims={};for(const state of ['Idle','Walk','Attack','Shoot','Hurt','Sleep','Charge','SpAttack']){let a=all[state]||all[state==='Idle'?'Walk':state];const seen=new Set();while(a?.copy&&all[a.copy]&&!seen.has(a.name)){seen.add(a.name);a=all[a.copy]}if(a?.width&&a?.height&&a.durations.length)anims[state]={...a,path:base+a.name+'-Anim.png'}}if(!anims.Idle||!anims.Walk)return false;view.pmd??={};view.pmd[id]={anims,portrait:`https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PMDCollab/SpriteCollab/master/portrait/${String(id).padStart(4,'0')}/Normal.png`};view.loadPmd?.();return true}catch{return false}})();view.pmdRequests.set(id,request);return request}
